\p \v 5 \w When this was reported|strong="H05046"\w* \w to David|strong="H01732"\w*, \w he sent messengers|strong="H07971"\w* \w to meet [the men]|strong="H07122"\w*, \w since|strong="H03588"\w* \w they had been|strong="H01961"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00582"\w* \w thoroughly|strong="H03966"\w* \w humiliated|strong="H03637"\w*. \w The king|strong="H04428"\w* \w told them|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Stay|strong="H03427"\w* \w in Jericho|strong="H03405"\w* \w until|strong="H05704"\w* \w your beards|strong="H02206"\w* \w have grown back|strong="H06779"\w*, \w and [then] return|strong="H07725"\w*.”
