\p \v 15 \w When the Arameans|strong="H00758"\w* \w saw|strong="H07200"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w they had been defeated|strong="H05062"\w* \w by|strong="H06440"\w* \w Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w they regrouped|strong="H00622"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03162"\w*. \v 16 \w Hadadezer|strong="H01909"\w* \w sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w messengers to bring|strong="H03318"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w [more] Arameans|strong="H00758"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w from beyond|strong="H05676"\w* \w the Euphrates|strong="H05104"\w*,\f + \fr 10:16 \ft Hebrew \fqa the River\f* \w and they came|strong="H00935"\w* \w to Helam|strong="H02431"\w* \w with Shobach|strong="H07731"\w*\f + \fr 10:16 \fqa Shobach \ft is a variant of \fqa Shophach\ft ; see 1 Chronicles 19:16.\f* \w the commander|strong="H08269"\w* \w of Hadadezer’s|strong="H01909"\w* \w army|strong="H06635"\w* \w leading them|strong="H06440"\w*.
\p \v 17 \w When this was reported|strong="H05046"\w* \w to David|strong="H01732"\w*, \w he gathered|strong="H00622"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w crossed|strong="H05674"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w and went|strong="H00935"\w* \w to Helam|strong="H02431"\w*. \w Then the Arameans|strong="H00758"\w* \w arrayed themselves|strong="H06186"\w* \w against|strong="H07122"\w* \w David|strong="H01732"\w* \w and fought|strong="H03898"\w* \w against him|strong="H05973"\w*. \v 18 \w But the Arameans|strong="H00758"\w* \w fled|strong="H05127"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w and David|strong="H01732"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00758"\w* \w killed|strong="H02026"\w* \w seven|strong="H07651"\w* \w hundred|strong="H03967"\w* \w charioteers|strong="H07393"\w* \w and forty|strong="H00705"\w* \w thousand|strong="H00505"\w* \w foot soldiers|strong="H06571"\w*.\f + \fr 10:18 \ft Some LXX manuscripts (see also 1 Chronicles 19:18); Hebrew \fqa horsemen\f* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w He also struck down|strong="H05221"\w* \w Shobach|strong="H07731"\w* \w the commander|strong="H08269"\w* \w of their army|strong="H06635"\w*, \w who died|strong="H04191"\w* \w there|strong="H08033"\w*.
