\p \v 15 \w Now therefore|strong="H06258"\w*, \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w I have come|strong="H00935"\w* \w to present|strong="H01696"\w* \w this|strong="H02088"\w* \w matter|strong="H01697"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w my lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w have made me afraid|strong="H03372"\w*. \w Your servant|strong="H08198"\w* \w thought|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w I will speak|strong="H01696"\w* \w . . .|strong="H04994"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w*. \w Perhaps|strong="H00194"\w* \w [he]|strong="H04428"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w will grant|strong="H06213"\w* \w the request|strong="H01697"\w* \w of his maidservant|strong="H00519"\w*. \v 16 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w will hear|strong="H08085"\w* \w and deliver|strong="H05337"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w his maidservant|strong="H00519"\w* \w from the hand|strong="H03709"\w* \w of the man|strong="H00376"\w* \w [who would] cut off|strong="H08045"\w* \w both|strong="H03162"\w* \w me|strong="H00853"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w my son|strong="H01121"\w* \w from God’s|strong="H00430"\w* \w inheritance|strong="H05159"\w*.’
\p \v 17 \w And now your servant|strong="H08198"\w* \w . . .|strong="H04994"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w May|strong="H01961"\w* \w the word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of my lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w bring me rest|strong="H04496"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w my lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w is able to discern|strong="H08085"\w* \w good|strong="H02896"\w* \w and evil|strong="H07451"\w*, \w just like the angel|strong="H04397"\w*\f + \fr 14:17 \ft Or \fqa Angel\ft ; also in verse 20\f* \w of God|strong="H00430"\w*. \w . . .|strong="H03651"\w* \w May the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w* \w be|strong="H01961"\w* \w with you|strong="H05973"\w*.’”
