\s1 Absalom Reconciled to David
\p \v 28 \w Now Absalom|strong="H00053"\w* \w lived|strong="H03427"\w* \w in Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w* \w two|strong="H08141"\w* \w years|strong="H03117"\w* \w without|strong="H03808"\w* \w seeing|strong="H07200"\w* \w the face|strong="H06440"\w* \w of the king|strong="H04428"\w*. \v 29 \w Then [he]|strong="H00053"\w* \w sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w for|strong="H00413"\w* \w Joab|strong="H03097"\w* \w to send|strong="H07971"\w* \w him|strong="H00853"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w*, \w but Joab refused|strong="H03808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00014"\w* \w to come|strong="H00935"\w* \w to him|strong="H00413"\w*.
