\s1 Hushai Counters Ahithophel’s Advice
\p \v 1 \w Furthermore, Ahithophel|strong="H00302"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Absalom|strong="H00053"\w*, “\w Let me choose|strong="H00977"\w* \w . . .|strong="H04994"\w* \w twelve|strong="H08147"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06240"\w* \w thousand|strong="H00505"\w* \w men|strong="H00376"\w* \w and set out|strong="H06965"\w* \w tonight|strong="H03915"\w* \w in pursuit of|strong="H07291"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00310"\w* \w David|strong="H01732"\w*. \v 2 \w I will attack him|strong="H00935"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05921"\w* \w while he|strong="H01931"\w* \w is weak|strong="H07504"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w and weary|strong="H03023"\w*; \w I will throw him into a panic|strong="H02729"\w*, \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w with him|strong="H00854"\w* \w will flee|strong="H05127"\w*; \w I will strike down|strong="H05221"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w only|strong="H00905"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w* \v 3 \w and bring all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w back|strong="H07725"\w* \w to you|strong="H00413"\w* \w as a bride|strong="H03605"\w* \w returning to her husband|strong="H07725"\w*. \w You|strong="H00859"\w* \w seek the life|strong="H01245"\w* \w of only one man|strong="H00376"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00834"\w*;\f + \fr 17:3 \ft LXX; see also DSS; MT \fqa and bring all the people back to you. When everyone returns except the man you seek,\f* \w then all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w at peace|strong="H07965"\w*.”
