\p \w Yet my lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w the king [is]|strong="H04428"\w* \w like the angel|strong="H04397"\w*\f + \fr 19:27 \ft Or \fqa Angel\f* \w of God|strong="H00430"\w*, \w so do|strong="H06213"\w* \w [what is] good|strong="H02896"\w* \w in your eyes|strong="H05869"\w*. \v 28 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01961"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of my grandfather|strong="H00001"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03588"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00518"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00376"\w* \w deserves death|strong="H04194"\w* \w from my lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w*, \w yet you have set|strong="H07896"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w your servant|strong="H05650"\w* \w among those who eat|strong="H00398"\w* \w at your table|strong="H07979"\w*. \w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w further|strong="H05750"\w* \w right, then|strong="H06666"\w*, \w do I have|strong="H03426"\w* . . . \w to keep|strong="H05750"\w* \w appealing|strong="H02199"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the king|strong="H04428"\w*?”
