\p \w Then|strong="H00227"\w* \w David’s|strong="H01732"\w* \w men|strong="H00582"\w* \w swore|strong="H07650"\w* to him, \w . . .|strong="H00559"\w* “\w You must never|strong="H03808"\w* \w again|strong="H05750"\w* \w go out|strong="H03318"\w* \w with us|strong="H00854"\w* \w to battle|strong="H04421"\w*, \w so that the lamp|strong="H05216"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w may not|strong="H03808"\w* \w be extinguished|strong="H03518"\w*.” \w -|strong="H00853"\w*
