\q2 \w the foundations|strong="H04146"\w* \w of the heavens|strong="H08064"\w*\f + \fr 22:8 \ft Most Hebrew sources; Vulgate, Syriac, and two Hebrew manuscripts (see also Psalm 18:7) \fqa mountains\f* \w trembled|strong="H07264"\w*;
\q2 \w they were shaken|strong="H01607"\w* \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w He burned with anger|strong="H02734"\w*.
