\q2 \w according to my cleanness|strong="H01252"\w* \w in|strong="H05048"\w* \w His sight|strong="H05869"\w*.\f + \fr 22:25 \ft Hebrew; LXX and Vulgate (see also Psalm 18:24) \fqa according to the cleanness of my hands\f*
\b 
