\q2 \w the Rock|strong="H06697"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w said|strong="H01696"\w* to me,
\q1 ‘\w He who rules|strong="H04910"\w* \w the people|strong="H00120"\w* \w with justice|strong="H06662"\w*,
